  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 96c021855e1828b4e984249e4880b8eb, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0c455ee3c0906e242b43fc86fb7d9d63, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15376df08a7f5a14ab6a997817c0be29, type: 3}
  subtitles:
  - "Routine check-in. Operator ID: 79853305. Power levels stable. Kenomorph activity\u2019s
    low\u2014just scattered movement for now, but you never know"
  - "The job is obviously tedious and life-threatening. But we\u2019re here to clean
    this place up\u2014saving the world, right? Fire up the purification systems,
    keep the infection under control."
  - If we do this right, we will take back the facility, stopping it from spreading
    and bringing everything back online.
  - "ROAM\u2019s got us a solid deal. They called us in because we\u2019re the best."
  - "Damn good pay, a decent war story to take home\u2014what\u2019s not to love?"
  - "Bonus, better hours, and I finally get to build Lily\u2019s princess castle."
  - "She\u2019s been on me about it for months. Not just any castle, she wants the
    whole pink-and-gold fairy tale setup. Towers, flags, the works in the backyard."
  - "Told her I\u2019d do it when I had the time. Well, maybe right after this mission."
  - "Let\u2019s get these batteries delivered. Got a castle to build."
  - "Something\u2019s wrong with the operation. All of it."
  - "It\u2019s faster than it should. Faster than they said it would."
  - "There were two hundred of us in this facility a week ago. Now? We\u2019re down
    to what\u2026 eighty? Seventy? Maybe less. Doesn\u2019t matter."
  - Some of them are still here. Just... not all in one place.
  - "ROAM\u2019s not responding. No reinforcements. No emergency evac. Just an open
    channel of silence.\u201D  \u201CIt feels like\u2026 they abandoned us\u2026"
  - "No. They must have something else in mind\u2026 something worse. Something beyond
    anything I can imagine."
  - "Sooner or later, I\u2019ll just be another number lost. Another body they won\u2019t
    even bother recovering\u2026"
  - "Alright. The situation needs to look messy. Helmet cracked, visor shattered,
    and a random burned body\u2026 they\u2019ll buy it."
  - "When they check the records, it\u2019ll make sense."
  - "Anyway. Lily\u2019s gonna love the castle."
  subtitleText: {fileID: 6345925265545812356, guid: 195a078d548deff4eb9896baedd42bc7,
    type: 3}
